{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/909791-pure-tribe-infiltrator","id":909791,"title":"Pure Tribe Infiltrator","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-07T20:43:13-07:00","id":909791,"title":"Pure Tribe Infiltrator","content":"I feel like I've seen this idea before, but can't seem to find it. I want to have a Fire-Touched wandering around my Pack's territory (and their Protectorate's territories as well) posing as a Ghost Wolf. But won't they figure him out pretty quick in the spirit world with his fiery brands? Is there a Rite or Gift that stops this? I flipped through the 1st E Pure Tribes books and came up with nothing. Any help would be appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6533-gingerkid88","name":"Gingerkid88","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-07T20:50:33-07:00","id":909795,"title":"","content":"There's the Liar's Brand gift (Stalker's Moon), but it's Irraka only<br /> <br /> I'd just houserule a rite and call it a day.<br /> <br /> Actually there's Rite of the New Coat, which I think exists specifically for that reason. It's in Lodges the Splintered, pg 131.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","user":"Amravanti","date":". 06-08-2016, 12:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-08T03:32:28-07:00","id":909954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amravanti</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/909791-pure-tribe-infiltrator?p=909795#post909795\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's the Liar's Brand gift (Stalker's Moon), but it's Irraka only<br /> <br /> I'd just houserule a rite and call it a day.<br /> <br /> Actually there's Rite of the New Coat, which I think exists specifically for that reason. It's in Lodges the Splintered, pg 131.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also talens which dye spirit brands in the Pure book. Sounds like that's the easiest way to pull it off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-08T14:02:38-07:00","id":910311,"title":"","content":"I knew there was a thing! Thanks. (I was okay house ruling it, but when my players called BS later or tried to see through his disguise I wanted to have something printed to reference)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6533-gingerkid88","name":"Gingerkid88","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-11T01:45:53-07:00","id":912150,"title":"","content":"Wouldn't the Fire-Touched Ban be a little problematic, though?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-11T08:06:43-07:00","id":912232,"title":"","content":"You might try looking into the balehounds, as they specialize in exactly that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-11T08:08:45-07:00","id":912236,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NateD</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/909791-pure-tribe-infiltrator?p=912150#post912150\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wouldn't the Fire-Touched Ban be a little problematic, though?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, but Pure have been known to put their Oaths aside if it leads to fucking with the Forsaken.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-11T14:05:53-07:00","id":912424,"title":"","content":"Yea, there's a handful of Fire-Touched rites that deal with lying and other sins that I could have him preform to atone. But now I'm looking at the Indigam &quot;Heralds&quot; and am thinking that's more interesting in the long run.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6533-gingerkid88","name":"Gingerkid88","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-11T16:40:42-07:00","id":912520,"title":"","content":"Excellent! Heralds are very cool! (if by &quot;cool&quot; you mean &quot;creepy as all get-out&quot;, which I do.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://